    "Replace cleanup-only disconnect timer with bounded reconnect attempts after 1, 3 and 8 seconds; no recurring polling after budget exhaustion. Stable 30-second operation resets outage budget; explicit mode/server/permission changes allow a fresh attempt.",
    "Listen to own-worker Binder death and disconnected/binding-died/null-binding callbacks; coalesce stale callbacks by connection epoch.",
    "Bound CONNECT handshake with a separate two-slot native-read executor (2500ms); late results cannot change a new or closed client.",
    "Separate successful empty-foreground snapshot from pending connection; clear old target metadata. Track snapshot generation even after an empty scene so an older reply cannot restore it.",
    "Worker clears invalid foreground task metadata and previous moved-to-front deduplication state. Matching delays, cooldown, maxima, input parameters and subscription documents unchanged."
  ],
